  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759418,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 128-in-1 Junior Console - Set 4: Donkey Kong Jr. (Atari 2600)\n\nRelive the arcade classic with this faithful Atari 2600 port of *Donkey Kong Jr.*! In a role reversal from the original *Donkey Kong*, you now control the adorable Donkey Kong Jr., tasked with rescuing his captured father from the clutches of the villainous Mario. Navigate four distinct stages, each brimming with unique challenges and enemies. \n\nUtilize DK Jr.'s abilities to run, jump, and skillfully climb vines, chains, and ropes to ascend the screen. Dodge Snapjaws, Nitpickers, and Sparks by strategically jumping and utilizing fruit to clear the path. Successfully reach the keys in the first three stages to free your father, then push six keys into locks to complete the final stage and secure his release. \n\nThis conversion, praised for its \"supergame adaptation\" and arcade-like graphics and sound, captures the essence of the original while delivering a compelling experience on the Atari 2600. Be warned, however, a notorious \"kill screen\" exists at level 22, adding a layer of challenge to your quest!"
    },
